==Battleground==
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Ranma Saotome (M) (Enemy)|Ranma Saotome (M)]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Mousse (Enemy)|Mousse]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
First, ignore One Horn and wait for the boss to spawn. Then spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] so that he either hits the boss and Gabriel with the same attack or gets knocked back by the Gabriel. Lastly, spawn any other units that you brought. The only issue in this stage is the [[Weaken|weaken]] effect. On {{1c}} if you time A. Bahamut well, the boss should die from two of his hits (three if he killed Gabriel and got weakened). After that it should be easy to deal with Mousse before the One Horn blocks him.

